{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":255,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1915393,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287595,"Name":"heatherd26","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287595.jpg?_r=1471732058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1471881544,"LastPoster":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1915393,"PostDate":1471881544,"PostContent":"Hi everyone! \u00a0 How much time in advance should we be looking into what the groom is wearing for t...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather_d26@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471733549,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287595.jpg?_r=1471732058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"heatherd26","Id":287595,"Name":"heatherd26","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80269,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c17369b13e3983c1be0520c8f951821d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How much time in advance should we be looking into what the groom is wearing for the wedding? I know that it doesn&#039;t take 8 months like our dresses to alter his clothing so I&#039;m wondering how much time in advance your groom got theirs? Also, where is a good place to purchase this clothing? We are definitely considering linen as it will be so hot.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915393,"PostDate":1471881544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How much time in advance should we be looking into what the groom is wearing for the wedding? I know that it doesn't take 8 months like our dresses to alter his clothing so I'm wondering how much time in advance your groom got theirs? Also, where is a good place to purchase this clothing? We are definitely considering linen as it will be so hot.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather_d26@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471733549,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287595.jpg?_r=1471732058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"heatherd26","Id":287595,"Name":"heatherd26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.123.7.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80269,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06d06a6df411c323ee1ec9aaca9801e7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Our wedding is next May and my finance and the groomsmen are heading out around Christmas time to get their attire. We are kind of stuck to this timeline because one groomsmen lives in another province and this is the only time everyone can get together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are thinking linen as well.. I think Banana Republic and Le Chateau have linen pants. I haven&#039;t actually physically looked anywhere yet though, just a quick browse online. I will probably go &#039;pre-shopping&#039; with my fiance early December to make him try on stuff and see what is even available at stores.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915396,"PostDate":1471882424,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Our wedding is next May and my finance and the groomsmen are heading out around Christmas time to get their attire. We are kind of stuck to this timeline because one groomsmen lives in another province and this is the only time everyone can get together.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are thinking linen as well.. I think Banana Republic and Le Chateau have linen pants. I haven't actually physically looked anywhere yet though, just a quick browse online. I will probably go 'pre-shopping' with my fiance early December to make him try on stuff and see what is even available at stores.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cadeau.samantha@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.123.7.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461181493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286776.jpg?_r=1461191272","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scadeau","Id":286776,"Name":"scadeau","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.185.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80269,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b61a79fc17a61021369b8eae414b20e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;If you get off-the-rack clothing from retail stores, then you don&#039;t really need an advanced time. &amp;nbsp;If you get a tailored suit from Moore&#039;s, then I&#039;m sure you would need to do it in advance.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Le Chateau has a linen suit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.lechateau.com\/style\/jump\/product-bundle%3ASSLOOK341986_053\/productDetail\/Occasion+Suits\/SSLOOK341986_053\/cat39240906&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.lechateau.com\/style\/jump\/product-bundle%3ASSLOOK341986_053\/productDetail\/Occasion+Suits\/SSLOOK341986_053\/cat39240906&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance bought his suit at RW&amp;amp;Co. &amp;nbsp;Him and his boys are most likely going to H&amp;amp;M to buy pants and accessories but if they can&#039;t find anything, then Express and Le Chateau are a last resort. &amp;nbsp;Also depending on how much your fiance wants to spend\/location, you can go to Harry Rosen and Hugo Boss.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915405,"PostDate":1471898932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>If you get off-the-rack clothing from retail stores, then you don't really need an advanced time. \u00a0If you get a tailored suit from Moore's, then I'm sure you would need to do it in advance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Le Chateau has a linen suit:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.lechateau.com\/style\/jump\/product-bundle%3ASSLOOK341986_053\/productDetail\/Occasion+Suits\/SSLOOK341986_053\/cat39240906' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.lechateau...053\/cat39240906<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance bought his suit at RW&Co. \u00a0Him and his boys are most likely going to H&M to buy pants and accessories but if they can't find anything, then Express and Le Chateau are a last resort. \u00a0Also depending on how much your fiance wants to spend\/location, you can go to Harry Rosen and Hugo Boss.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falleneight@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.26.14.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441734631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284728.jpg?_r=1448387511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"OttawaBride2017","Id":284728,"Name":"OttawaBride2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80269,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by heatherd26, 22 August 2016 - 01:38 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1471901921,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d368d9050fe25d7be33f60aa95bfe61e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank so much! Oh wow, that suit is great! Thanks for sharing! My wedding isn&#039;t for another year so I will likely wait until after Christmas, I think! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915406,"PostDate":1471901889,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank so much! Oh wow, that suit is great! Thanks for sharing! My wedding isn't for another year so I will likely wait until after Christmas, I think! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather_d26@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.254.20.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471733549,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287595.jpg?_r=1471732058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"heatherd26","Id":287595,"Name":"heatherd26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"182.77.13.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80269,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb417877a6b3c1a5dd7719a8f5fe84ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hi guys just looking for a good place to buy wedding supplies materials? Any