arried on a beach. I was discussing with my fiance about buying the wedding bands. I like to get the thin bands with small tiny diamonds. A friend recommended me a fine diamond jeweler. (&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.pheradiamonds.com\/shop\/delicate-diamond-band\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.pheradiamonds.com\/shop\/delicate-diamond-band\/&lt;\/a&gt;)&amp;nbsp;Looks like we found one we were looking for. But, now I&#039;m rethinking, will it look like a string on my big hand? Should I go for a wider band?   &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914484,"PostDate":1466496443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our wedding is near. We have decided to get married on a beach. I was discussing with my fiance about buying the wedding bands. I like to get the thin bands with small tiny diamonds. A friend recommended me a fine diamond jeweler. (<a href='http:\/\/www.pheradiamonds.com\/shop\/delicate-diamond-band\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.pheradiam...e-diamond-band\/<\/a>)\u00a0Looks like we found one we were looking for. But, now I'm rethinking, will it look like a string on my big hand? Should I go for a wider band? \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blueplanet46@outlook.com","IpAddress":"85.203.45.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466419460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287201.jpg?_r=1466416122","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rays123","Id":287201,"Name":"Rays123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.58.205.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39e9105447eb8743f7da4f6c1ff8f2d7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;How much it will cost for the whole band your hired?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914487,"PostDate":1466511211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>How much it will cost for the whole band your hired?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"f.dernando@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"116.58.200.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466305501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kellian","Id":287193,"Name":"Kellian","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.247.211.203","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"189d765cff73098927107ce903796fbe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It is slightly looking like a band, if in the same price you get bigger ring than this one, then for sure go for that.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914503,"PostDate":1466588042,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It is slightly looking like a band, if in the same price you get bigger ring than this one, then for sure go for that.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessahodge26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.247.211.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465811553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Venessa26","Id":287136,"Name":"Venessa26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.185.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e257cc0a00c0f2d8cbd9b9e683802aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"Rays123\"],&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m actually thinking of a thin ring myself. &amp;nbsp;I suggest you try on your wedding ring before buying because you never know how it actually looks on your hand until you try it on.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914511,"PostDate":1466625267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287201\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287201-rays123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Rays123<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>I'm actually thinking of a thin ring myself. \u00a0I suggest you try on your wedding ring before buying because you never know how it actually looks on your hand until you try it on.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falleneight@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.26.14.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441734631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284728.jpg?_r=1448387511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"OttawaBride2017","Id":284728,"Name":"OttawaBride2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.19.252.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"969ef6b85f218f2977e5225deea6e740","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yesterday , We went to the jewelers and tried on the rings. It looked good. I&#039;m happy now.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you very much.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914528,"PostDate":1466659927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yesterday , We went to the jewelers and tried on the rings. It looked good. I'm happy now.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you very much.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blueplanet46@outlook.com","IpAddress":"85.203.45.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466419460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287201.jpg?_r=1466416122","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rays123","Id":287201,"Name":"Rays123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"212.178.244.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83ff27713ac3d51ad0b5fd101363a858","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey girls, I just wanted to recommend an online jewelry store where I&#039;ve found bands for my US wedding (Miamiii :)))) ).They offer &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.azeera.com\/product\/browsering_veiw?category=Ring&amp;amp;section=0&#039;&gt;custom made gemstone rings&lt;\/a&gt; and bands and I was really pleased with the price and quality.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So just a recommendation from me since I&#039;ve found great tips on this forum :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915285,"PostDate":1471020564,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey girls, I just wanted to recommend an online jewelry store where I've found bands for my US wedding (Miamiii <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>))) ).They offer <a href='https:\/\/www.azeera.com\/product\/browsering_veiw?category=Ring&section=0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>custom made gemstone rings<\/a> and bands and I was really pleased with the price and quality.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So just a recommendation from me since I've found great tips on this forum <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janejohnson718@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"212.178.244.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471020254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"melisaaa","Id":287549,"Name":"melisaaa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"115.75.3.40","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7825f4c70b97c9610d359c6f792c26c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That is so amazing. How much it will cost?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915356,"PostDate":1471612405,"PostContent"